          %h2#pseudoprimes_and_carmichael_numbers Pseudoprimes and Carmichael numbers
          %p
            Fermat’s little theorem says that in order for a positive integer
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
