                    %mi n
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
              implies the further reduction
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi a
                      %mi n
                    %mo ≡
                    %mi a
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:lspace => "mediummathspace"} (
                      %mo{:rspace => "thinmathspace"} mod
                      %mi n
                      %mo{:rspace => "mediummathspace"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} a^n \equiv a \pmod{n}
              by Fermat’s little theorem.
          %p
            Given an integer
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
